                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>The Boinville family had a long association with the Godwins. Alfred was the son of <persName key="BOI02">Chastel</persName> and 
      <persName key="BOI01">Harriet</persName>. The Godwins and the Boinvilles became close in the 
    1800s. The Boinvilles were close friends of the <persName key="NEW01">Newtons</persName>, another family of fervent Godwinians.</p>
                    <p>For a fuller discussion see <persName key="BOI01">Harriet Boinville</persName></p>
                    </note>
